msgid "Unknown application"
msgstr "Feidhmchlár anaithnid"

msgid "No AT-SPI-exposed shortcuts found for this application.\nGTK app? Try Ctrl+? — many bind their own shortcuts window to it."
msgstr "Níor aimsíodh aon aicearraí atá nochta trí AT-SPI don fheidhmchlár seo.\nAn feidhmchlár GTK é? Bain triail as Ctrl+? — ceanglaíonn go leor acu a bhfuinneog aicearraí féin leis."
